H69 - CROSS-VENUE PREMIUM, STRATEGY GRADE (family F2, trials 165-167)
====================================================================================================

Universe: 20 symbols (inherited from H68). Traded leg: frozen lake, 2019-01-01 -> 2026-07-10
Signal: s2_adj_premium rank >= 0.90 of trailing 90d; 889 entry days carry at least one qualifier
Execution: decisions at the close, fills at the NEXT bar's open, 10bp fee + 1bp
           half-spread + 25bp participation impact, per side.

